00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:48.140
Joe, unfortunately, is still satellite here, but I heard the Winter Olympics are beautiful.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.000
Yeah, yes, they're great here.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.860
Okay, and what a timely thing to go to the Winter Olympics for.

